@startuml
title Controller runtime and service architecture

skinparam backgroundColor transparent
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

class ControllerModel {
  -selected : RgbColor
  -presets[4] : RgbColor
  -brightness : uint8_t
  -powerOn : bool
  -mode : OutputMode
  +select(color)
  +setBrightness(brightness)
  +togglePower()
  +setMode(mode)
  +storePreset(index)
}

class InteractionController {
  +poll(now, actions[2]) : uint8_t
}

class TouchTask <<coroutine>> {
  +monitorTouchInput()
}

class UiActionQueue <<SimpleAwait Queue<UiAction, 8>>> {
  +send(action)
  +receive() : UiAction
}

class ApplicationTask <<coroutine>> {
  +processUiActions()
}

class TouchDispatcher {
  +update(touching, point, now) : UiAction
}

class UiActionProcessor {
  +process(action, now)
}

class ControllerMessages <<coalesced mailboxes>> {
  +requestLighting(resetEnvelope)
  +takeLighting() : LightingMessage
  +requestUi(refresh)
  +takeUi() : UiMessage
  +noteManualColor(color, now)
  +queuePresetSave(index, color, now)
  +takePersistence() : PersistenceMessage
  +requestAudio(cue)
  +takeAudio() : AudioCue
}

class LightingTask <<coroutine>> {
  +updateLighting()
}

class UiTask <<coroutine>> {
  +updateEffectUi()
}

class PersistenceTask <<coroutine>> {
  +persistStableManualColor()
}

class AudioTask <<coroutine>> {
  +service(touchBus, messages)
}

class LightingOutput {
  +begin()
  +apply(now)
  +previewColor() : RgbColor
  +resetMusicEnvelope()
}

class AddressableLedStrip {
  +begin() : bool
  +setPixelColor(index, color)
  +setBrightness(brightness)
  +show()
}

class ColorPersistenceService {
  +begin(model) : bool
  +noteManualColor(color, now)
  +cancelManualColor()
  +queuePresetSave(index, color, now)
  +process(now, model)
}

class AudioFeedback <<namespace>> {
  +start(touchBus, messages) : bool
  +microphoneStatus() : MicrophoneStatus
  +readMicrophoneLevel(magnitude) : bool
}

class ES8311 <<library>> {
  +create(bus, address) : handle
  +init_begin(handle) : esp_err_t
  +init_finish(handle) : esp_err_t
  +microphone_config(handle) : esp_err_t
  +voice_volume_set(handle, volume) : esp_err_t
  +voice_mute(handle, mute) : esp_err_t
}

class UiRenderer {
  +drawInitialUi(effectColor)
  +drawDynamicUi(effectColor)
  +drawElement(id, effectColor) : bool
  +notifyElement(id, notification) : bool
  +flushDisplay()
}

class UiScene {
  +drawInitial(context)
  +draw(context)
  +draw(id, context) : bool
  +notify(id, notification) : bool
}

class ST77922_TOUCH <<hardware adapter>>
class ST77922 <<hardware adapter>>
class TFT_eSprite <<framebuffer>>

InteractionController --> ST77922_TOUCH : reads samples
InteractionController --> TouchDispatcher : forwards samples
InteractionController --> TouchTask : returns actions
TouchTask --> UiActionQueue : publishes, suspends on backpressure
UiActionQueue --> ApplicationTask : ordered actions
ApplicationTask --> UiActionProcessor : invokes
UiActionProcessor --> ControllerModel : updates state
UiActionProcessor --> ControllerMessages : publishes effects

ControllerMessages --> LightingTask : latest lighting request
LightingTask --> ControllerMessages : UI invalidation after apply
ControllerMessages --> UiTask : coalesced dirty mask
ControllerMessages --> PersistenceTask : latest/per-preset requests
ControllerMessages --> AudioTask : strongest pending cue

LightingTask --> LightingOutput : sole runtime writer
UiTask --> UiRenderer : sole runtime renderer
PersistenceTask --> ColorPersistenceService : sole runtime owner
AudioTask --> AudioFeedback : codec and I2S owner

LightingOutput --> ControllerModel : reads output state
LightingOutput *-- AddressableLedStrip
LightingOutput --> AudioFeedback : takes latest level
AudioFeedback --> ES8311 : configures shared-bus codec

ColorPersistenceService --> ControllerModel : restores and persists
UiRenderer --> ControllerModel : reads display state
UiRenderer --> UiScene : delegates element drawing
UiRenderer --> TFT_eSprite : draws complete frame
UiRenderer --> ST77922 : transfers frame

note bottom of UiActionProcessor
  Called only by the application task.
  Mutates the model and publishes messages;
  performs no device I/O.
end note

note bottom of ControllerMessages
  Continuous state coalesces to the latest value.
  Preset persistence retains one value per slot.
end note

note bottom of AudioFeedback
  Audio task exclusively owns codec and I2S.
  Lighting consumes published amplitude samples.
end note
@enduml
